      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>Periksa label</h2><p>Cocokkan hasil pembacaan dengan informasi pada kemasan.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{background:var(--surface,#fffefd);color:var(--ink,#352331);border:1px solid var(--line,#ddced8);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;box-shadow:none;font:400 15px/1.55 \"Work Sans\",sans-serif}.ds-panel h2{font-size:23px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-panel p{color:var(--muted,#705c6b);margin:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Provisional photo result and source disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "quick-verdict",
      "description": "Photo-result hierarchy with explicit missing readings and separately attributed source detail; labelled specimen content.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-photo\"><h1>Contoh tampilan hasil</h1><p class=\"ds-origin\">Contoh antarmuka · bukan analisis produk</p><section class=\"ds-verdict\"><h2>Gulanya belum bisa dipastikan.</h2><p class=\"ds-action\">Foto ulang baris gula agar angkanya dapat dibandingkan. Angka lain yang terbaca tetap bisa Anda lihat.</p><dl class=\"ds-nutrients\"><div><dt>Gula / sajian</dt><dd>Tidak tersedia</dd><p>Foto ulang baris gula untuk memastikan.</p></div><div><dt>Natrium / sajian</dt><dd>Tidak tersedia</dd><p>Tidak diartikan sebagai nol.</p></div></dl><p class=\"ds-serving\">Angka gula total pada label tidak membedakan gula alami dan gula tambahan.</p><div class=\"ds-actions\"><button class=\"ds-button ds-primary\" type=\"button\">Foto ulang baris gula</button><button class=\"ds-button ds-ghost\" type=\"button\">Koreksi angka bila perlu</button></div></section><section class=\"ds-research\" aria-label=\"Pencarian dan validasi sumber produk\"><h2>Produk ini dikenali dari mana?</h2><p>Belum ada sumber yang cukup cocok. Barcode kemasan belum dicocokkan, jadi ini belum membuktikan formulasi yang sama.</p><details><summary>Rincian sumber &amp; kecocokan</summary><p>Foto Anda tetap menjadi sumber angka. Data internet tidak menimpa label, mengisi nilai kosong, atau dianggap membuktikan keamanan produk.</p><p class=\"ds-warning\">Sebagian sumber belum dapat divalidasi. Label kemasan tetap perlu diutamakan.</p></details></section></section>",
      "css": ".ds-photo{max-width:980px;color:var(--ink,#352331);font:400 15px/1.55 \"Work Sans\",sans-serif}.ds-photo h1{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:700;margin:0}.ds-origin{color:var(--muted,#705c6b);font-size:14px;margin:10px 0 20px}.ds-verdict{background:var(--surface,#fffefd);border:1px solid var(--line,#ddced8);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.ds-verdict h2{color:#491d36;font-size:clamp(23px,3vw,32px);font-weight:650;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-action{font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;font-weight:650;color:#491d36;max-width:68ch;margin:0 0 6px}.ds-nutrients{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-block:1px solid var(--line,#ddced8);padding:16px 0;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-nutrients>div{padding:8px 0}.ds-nutrients>div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--line,#ddced8);padding-left:24px}.ds-nutrients dt{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#705c6b)}.ds-nutrients dd{margin:0;font-size:clamp(23px,4vw,38px);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-nutrients p,.ds-serving{color:var(--muted,#705c6b);font-size:12px}.ds-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:20px}.ds-button{font:600 14px/1.35 \"Work Sans\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:46px;padding:11px 18px;border:0;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}.ds-primary{background:var(--accent,#571838);color:#fffafd}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#75334f}.ds-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--accent,#571838)}.ds-ghost:hover:not(:disabled){background:#ead9e4}.ds-button:active:not(:disabled){transform:scale(.98)}.ds-button:disabled{opacity:.48}.ds-button:focus-visible,.ds-research summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8e426a;outline-offset:3px}.ds-research{border-top:1px solid var(--line,#ddced8);padding:20px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65}.ds-research>h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:10px}.ds-research>p{max-width:68ch;margin:10px 0}.ds-research>details{margin-top:16px}.ds-research summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:650}.ds-warning{color:#775616}@media(max-width:520px){.ds-verdict{padding:18px}.ds-nutrients{gap:16px}.ds-nutrients>div+div{padding-left:14px}.ds-nutrients dt{font-size:12px}.ds-nutrients p{font-size:11px}.ds-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr}.ds-serving{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Indeks Belanja",
    "overview": "An approachable index for reading Indonesian food labels: confident mulberry fields, pale rose canvases, clear white reading surfaces and citron cues. Aligned rows and restrained rules connect the public ingredient index with the application’s nutrient comparisons. Rounded controls keep the working interface familiar.\n\nThe public introduction uses a larger voice; the application settles into compact, readable text and short groups of information. Work Sans provides continuity across both. Product language remains Indonesian. Blue and navy are excluded by the owner’s confirmed identity direction.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Mulberry orientation with rose and white reading layers.",
      "Citron for prominent scan actions and selected controls.",
      "One self-hosted variable font with tightly spaced headings.",
      "Aligned ingredient and nutrient rows with quiet dividers.",
      "Flat reading surfaces and restrained state motion."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Reading Layers Rule",
        "body": "Use pale rose for the page, white for bounded reading surfaces and thin rose-gray rules within them.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Family Rule",
        "body": "Keep Work Sans across headings, controls and reading text; vary scale, weight and spacing within the family.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Reading Rule",
        "body": "Keep reading panels at rest without shadows; reserve elevation for floating controls and dialogs.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use Work Sans and the established role hierarchy across public and application surfaces.",
      "Do preserve the distinction between rose canvas, white reading panels and mulberry orientation.",
      "Do pair semantic colors with visible status wording.",
      "Do retain tabular figures and aligned dividers for nutrient comparisons.",
      "Do preserve visible focus and reduced-motion behavior when extending controls."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don’t introduce blue or navy into this identity.",
      "Don’t carry the discarded charcoal, vermilion and Manrope identity into new surfaces.",
      "Don’t add a shadow to every reading panel or repeated row.",
      "Don’t treat illustrative ingredient imagery or specimen data as a measured product result."
    ]
  }
